  "findings": [
    "Little-endian BGRA bytes use the original DRM ARGB8888 unpack order, not DRM BGRA8888.",
    "Read-only resource discovery now reserves retained PP/MERGE_3D and pending CTL flush state. Each fresh DMA/ownership gate precedes all setup writes.",
    "DPU quiesce waits for actual INTF_STATUS and owned CTL flush completion. Timeout retains ownership and saved state; successful stop restores registers and permits repeated hotplug reuse.",
    "INTF0 hardware VSync uses original MDP0+INTR_EN/STATUS/CLEAR offsets; only owned bits24/25 are acknowledged. Native ArmCpu/IOWorkLoop wiring is not implemented by this helper.",
    "Native session joins production AUX/EDID, D0/D3, PLL/clocks, CR/EQ, rate/mode fallback and bounded teardown. Modes are real EDID modes; no fabricated fallback.",
    "Actual macOS 26C5035r IOAV getter/PixelClock instructions consume produced 80-byte data for all94 CTA modes and fractional refresh variants. This does not publish an external IOMFB service."
  ],
